This licence covers only the original content of this repository: the curation
manifest, the build and install scripts, the engineering-router skill, the eval
harness and corpus, and the documentation.

No upstream skill or plugin code is distributed with this repository. upstream/
and build/ are gitignored; scripts/sync.sh fetches the upstream sources onto your
machine at build time, and each source keeps its own licence there.

Build output is a different matter. The forked Trail of Bits plugins under
build/marketplace/ are CC BY-SA 4.0 and the vendored HashiCorp skills under
build/skills/ are MPL 2.0, both copyleft. scripts/build.py writes attribution and
a statement of changes into build/marketplace/NOTICE.md and into a .provenance.json
beside every vendored skill. If you redistribute your build output, honour them.

See CREDITS.md for the full attribution.
